### Saves a file uploaded for a thread. Returns { "fileId": 12345 }
POST http://localhost:4999/sdec-ipaas-stub/api/v1/thread/{thread-reference}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filename": "file.txt",
  "fileSize": 1234456,
  "filetype": "text/txt",
  "objectKey": "/uploads/{thread-ref}/file.txt",
  "etag": "4f8894d7eae7cc9c686872c5da5b3e98"
}
###

### DELETEs a file for a thread - replace with actual values from database
DELETE http://localhost:4999/sdec-ipaas-stub/api/v1/thread/{thread-reference}/file/{fileId}
